    "verdict": {
      "html": "<div class=\"verdict\"><div class=\"pct ok\">+58%</div>\n     <div><p class=\"call\">Fique com ele.</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">SpATK do seu contra um Gengar médio no mesmo nível. É o stat que define o dano dele.</p></div></div>\n   <div class=\"trio\"><div><small>Resistência vs médio</small><b>+38%</b></div><div><small>SpATK do máximo possível</small><b>89%</b></div><div><small>HP de combate</small><b>2.436</b></div></div>"
    },
    "stats": {
      "html": "<div class=\"radar-wrap\"><svg class=\"radar\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Radar dos stats contra o máximo\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"rg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"var(--t1)\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"var(--t2)\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n    <polygon points=\"150,30 245.26279441628824,85 245.26279441628827,194.99999999999997 150,250 54.73720558371177,195.00000000000003 54.737205583711756,84.99999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,57.5 221.4470958122162,98.75 221.4470958122162,181.25 150,222.5 78.55290418778382,181.25000000000003 78.55290418778381,98.74999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,85 197.6313972081441,112.5 197.63139720814414,167.5 150,195 102.36860279185589,167.50000000000003 102.36860279185588,112.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,112.5 173.81569860407205,126.25 173.81569860407205,153.75 150,167.5 126.18430139592795,153.75 126.18430139592795,126.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628824\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628827\" y2=\"194.99999999999997\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.73720558371177\" y2=\"195.00000000000003\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.737205583711756\" y2=\"84.99999999999999\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,88.9 198.2,112.1 197.6,167.5 150.0,201.8 100.7,168.5 101.3,111.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink-2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,71.3 213.6,103.3 213.3,176.5 150.0,237.7 77.3,182.0 66.4,91.8\" fill=\"url(#rg)\" fill-opacity=\".45\" stroke=\"url(#rg)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">HP</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">ATK</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"209.99999999999997\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">DEF</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"k\">SpATK</text><text x=\"35.684646700454124\" y=\"210.00000000000006\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpDEF</text><text x=\"35.68464670045411\" y=\"77.99999999999999\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SPD</text></svg><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">HP</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"HP: seu 203, médio 151, máximo 325\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:43.562231759656655%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:32.40343347639485%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(69.74248927038627% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">203</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">ATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"ATK: seu 207, médio 157, máximo 310\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:44.4206008583691%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:33.69098712446352%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(66.52360515021459% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">207</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">DEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"DEF: seu 198, médio 149, máximo 298\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:42.48927038626609%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:31.974248927038627%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(63.94849785407725% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">198</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm key\">SpATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpATK: seu 414, médio 262, máximo 466\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:88.8412017167382%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:56.223175965665234%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(100% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">414</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpDEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpDEF: seu 255, médio 173, máximo 334\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:54.72103004291846%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:37.1244635193133%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(71.67381974248927% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">255</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SPD</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SPD: seu 400, médio 233, máximo 456\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:85.83690987124463%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:50%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(97.85407725321889% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">400</span></div></div></div><p class=\"note\">Contorno tracejado no radar: exemplar médio. O ponto ao lado do nome marca o stat de ataque dele. Resistência é a média de HP, DEF e SpDEF contra o exemplar médio.</p>"
    },
    "imp": {
      "html": "<p style=\"margin:0\">Os golpes de dano dele são especiais: o <b>SpATK</b> (base 130) decide o dano. ATK só pesa na Investida, que é física.</p>\n   <div class=\"mins\">\n    <div><small>Qualidade mínima</small><b>1,3</b><span>sai em ~26% das capturas, cerca de 4</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SpATK</small><b>20+</b><span>a média é 16,5</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de HP e SpDEF</small><b>16+</b><span>define quanto aguenta antes da poção</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SPD</small><b>livre</b><span>só encurta a recarga</span></div>\n   </div>\n   <div><b>Para comparar dois Gengar</b><ol class=\"prio\"><li>Maior qualidade.</li><li>Empate de qualidade (até 0,05): maior IV de SpATK.</li><li>Depois IV de HP e SpDEF.</li><li>P2 e P3 desempatam. P4, P5 ou shiny passam na frente de tudo.</li></ol></div>\n   <div class=\"mult\">\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Bate forte</b><small>esses tipos apanham ×2+ dos golpes dele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6ba659\"><i></i>Planta<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d996aa\"><i></i>Fada<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d06688\"><i></i>Psíquico<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#73659a\"><i></i>Fantasma<em>×2</em></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Sofre de</b><small>esses tipos batem ×2,5+ nele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#c4a663\"><i></i>Terra<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d06688\"><i></i>Psíquico<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#73659a\"><i></i>Fantasma<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6f6258\"><i></i>Sombrio<em>×2,5</em></span></div>\n   </div>"
    },
    "escada": {
      "html": "<div class=\"escada\"><div class=\"degrau \" style=\"height:146.8px;--a:10%\">\n      <small>base</small><span class=\"dn\">Gastly</span><span class=\"bst\">310</span><small>BST · Fantasma/Veneno</small></div><div class=\"degrau \" style=\"height:173.4px;--a:28%\"><span class=\"salto\">Nv 50 · +31%</span>\n      <small>evolui no Nv 50</small><span class=\"dn\">Haunter</span><span class=\"bst\">405</span><small>BST · Fantasma/Veneno</small></div><div class=\"degrau eu\" style=\"height:200px;--a:46%\"><span class=\"salto\">Nv 100 · +23%</span><span class=\"pin\">você · Nv 150</span>\n      <small>evolui no Nv 100</small><span class=\"dn\">Gengar</span><span class=\"bst\">500</span><small>BST · Fantasma/Veneno</small></div></div><div class=\"escada-base\"></div>\n    <p class=\"escada-prog\">Gengar é o último degrau desta cadeia. Fonte: guia da comunidade; confirme a seta \"Precisa de Nv X\" no jogo antes de gastar pedra.</p>"
    },
    "hunt-lede": {
      "text": "74 hunts entre o Nv 90 e o Nv 160 simuladas com o seu exemplar. 11 são seguras (no pior intervalo de 5 s ele leva menos de 50% do HP). No topo ficam as que somam mais abates por hora em hunts de nível mais alto, que pagam mais."
    },
